# common_repo tracks ONLY the shared, cross-project guidance files.
# Everything else in this directory (each app is its own git repo) is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!maui_publish_to_google_play_guide.html
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/PLAYSTORE.md
# never: brevo-info.txt (credentials), .claude/settings.local.json (machine-local), app repos
